      <section className="pad" id="results" style={{ paddingTop: 'clamp(80px,12vw,170px)' }}>
      <div className="sh"><span className="lab">The result</span><span className="lab">A complete Brand-to-URL delivery</span></div>
      <div className="res"><div><b data-n="38">38</b><h3>slides of brand guidelines</h3><p>So any designer or developer can apply the identity correctly.</p></div><div><b data-n="7">7</b><h3>deliverables, one system</h3><ul className="tags7"><li>Identity</li><li>Custom pattern</li><li>Guidelines</li><li>Web</li><li>Social</li><li>Print</li><li>Development</li></ul></div></div>
      <div className="sh" style={{ marginTop: 'clamp(64px,9vw,120px)' }}><span className="lab">What guided it</span><span className="lab">Three design principles</span></div>
      <div className="pc3"><div><span className="lab">Principle one</span><h3>Ornament with a purpose</h3><p>Every motif in the identity comes from one flower and one arch, so decoration always means something.</p></div><div><span className="lab">Principle two</span><h3>A system, not a logo</h3><p>The mark, the pattern, the colours and the type work together, on a box, a post and a website.</p></div><div><span className="lab">Principle three</span><h3>Restraint is luxury</h3><p>Gold appears in small touches, like a thread of zari, so it keeps its value.</p></div></div>
      </section>
      
